New York City taking a bite out of the apple&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:54.160
as a sales and marketing term, getting some market&nbsp;
share. So the reality is that it's not unique that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.160 --> 00:03:00.720
with the term woman, we define it differently in&nbsp;
different contexts. The purpose of the definition&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:04.800
