That's a different purpose. It's a different.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:27.120
Context. And this is where we end up with the bad&nbsp;
faith. Republican questions about what is a woman.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:34.240
They want common nouns defined so that they can&nbsp;
